    "share_count_basis": "125.0M shares outstanding at 2026-09-30 (Q3-2026 10-Q balance sheet) plus ~0.6M treasury-method dilution (Q3 diluted 125.7M vs basic 125.1M) = 125.6M fully diluted. Already includes the restricted stock issued as part-consideration for Lovelytics (non-SBC issuance, ~0.3M shares, so no forward issuance is modelled). Held FLAT because SBC is fully expensed in the flows. CDW is a repurchaser ($653M FY2025, $652.7M 9M-2026), so the flat count is funded, not a convention.",
    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free ~4.2% (10y UST), beta ~1.05, ERP 5.0% -> cost of equity ~9.5%. Pre-tax cost of debt ~5.8% (new notes 5.70-6.35%; legacy notes lower) -> ~4.4% after tax. Market-value weights ~74% equity ($19.7bn) / 26% debt ($7.1bn) -> ~8.2%; rounded up to 8.5% for the AI-hardware cyclicality in the near-term revenue. Same WACC in every scenario: risk is carried in the scenario paths and weights, not a WACC premium.",
